; Stage 15 W9 item 30 negative fixture: a NON-literal f64->f32 narrowing is
; unchanged — still lossy, still routed to `unsafe/cast`.
;
; The item makes "narrowing" a property of the VALUE where the value is known.
; A parameter is an unknown runtime value, so nothing about it fits, and this is
; the boundary that separates the fix from a blanket relaxation of the rule.
;
; Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "as: lossy conversion from f64 to f32 -- use unsafe/cast"
(defn narrow (d:f64):f32
  (return (as f32 d)))

(defn main ():i32
  (return (as i32 (as f64 (narrow 1.5)))))
